  "title": "Valentine Manilla Pepple",
  "content": "Chief Waripanye Valentine Manilla Pepple (born November 8, 1967) is a Nigerian lawyer, stockbroker, clergyman and traditional aristocrat. As Fubara XV, he currently serves as the alabo of the aristocratic Fubara Manilla Pepple chieftaincy house of Bonny.\n\n\n== References ==",
